A marker at an item content column opens a sublist, first in the item or not

```
- o
  - z

  para
  - s1
.
<ul>
  <li><p>o</p>
    <ul>
      <li>z</li>
    </ul>
    <p>para</p>
    <ul>
      <li>s1</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- o

  para
  - s1
.
<ul>
  <li><p>o</p>
    <p>para</p>
    <ul>
      <li>s1</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
| a |
para
- s1
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>para
- s1</p>
```
